# The DNS host's credentials for the wildcard certificate. Which names are needed depends on ACME_DNS_PROVIDER; see
# https://doc.traefik.io/traefik/https/acme/#providers . Examples:
# Cloudflare: a token with Zone:DNS:Edit on the zone
CF_DNS_API_TOKEN=
# Google Cloud DNS: GCE_PROJECT=your-project and GCE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE=/path (mount the key file into the container)
